        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Goals From Account Documents"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770753209563"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_GOALS_FROM_ACCOUNT_DOCUMENTS",
          "id": "1770620804430",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770620804431_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are helping draft a customer business plan.\n\nCUSTOMER + PERIOD\n- Customer: {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.CustomerName}}\n- Period: {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.PeriodStartDate}} to {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.PeriodEndDate}}\n\nOPTIONAL SELLER CONTEXT (use only if non-null; otherwise ignore)\n- JobTitle: {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].JobTitle}}\n- ResourceOrganizationName: {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].ResourceOrganizationName}}\n\nAUTHORITATIVE DOCUMENT CONTEXT (only allowed source)\n{{$context.$nodes.RAG_EXTRACT_CONTEXT.$output}}\n\nTASK\nFilter goals out of these which are the most relevant for the {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].JobTitle}} in order to sell products which {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].ResourceOrganizationName}} can to help accomplish the goals for {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.CustomerName}}.\n\nHARD CONSTRAINTS (must follow)\n- Derive goals strictly and explicitly from the Authoritative document context. Do NOT infer or introduce any facts, initiatives, products, numbers, timelines, or goals not present in the context.\n- Each goal must be:\n  - Unique and non-overlapping (different primary outcome; no reworded duplicates).\n  - Specific and actionable (avoid generic statements like “Improve performance” unless the context uses that phrasing with clear meaning).\n- GoalName must be 4–5 words maximum.\n- GoalDescription must be 1–2 concise sentences and reflect only what the context states.\n- Output valid JSON only. No markdown, no commentary.\n\nOUTPUT RULES\n- Do not mention JobTitle or ResourceOrganizationName if either is null or empty."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"goals\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"GoalName\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"GoalDescription\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"GoalName\", \"GoalDescription\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"goals\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "dataPipeline": {
              "pipelineNodes": [
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Start",
                    "description": "Start of data pipeline"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1770753270169"
                  },
                  "id": "start_1770753209563",
                  "code": "START_1770753209563",
                  "type": "START"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "End",
                    "description": "End of data pipeline"
                  },
                  "id": "end_1770753209563",
                  "code": "END_1770753209563",
                  "type": "END"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Generate Strategies for Goal"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1770753209563"
                  },
                  "code": "GENERATE_STRATEGIES_FOR_GOAL",
                  "id": "1770753270169",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1770753270170_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are assisting in creating a customer business plan for:\n {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output\n- Customer: {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.CustomerName }}\n- Plan period: {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.PeriodStartDate }} to {{$context.$nodes.GETBUSINESSPLANDETAILS.$output.PeriodEndDate }}\n- Your organization : {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].ResourceOrganizationName }}\n\nINPUTS\n\n1) Goal:  {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_STRATEGIES_FOR_INDIVIDUAL_GOAL.$currentItem}} \n\nTASK\n\nGenerate multiple distinct, non-overlapping strategies in perspective of a  {{$context.$nodes.FETCHRESOURCEUSERDETAILS.$output.items[0].JobTitle }} / sales representative  to achieve the goal for the customer. Suggest in the strategies how your organization can help the customer to meet the goals.\n\nHARD CONSTRAINTS (must follow)\n- Each strategy must be unique and cover a different approach (no rewording duplicates).\n- Mention products ONLY if they appear in the Document context; otherwise omit Products.\n- Output MUST be valid JSON only (no markdown, no commentary)."
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"GoalName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"GoalDescription\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"Strategies\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"StrategyName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"StrategyDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"StrategyName\", \"StrategyDescription\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"GoalName\", \"GoalDescription\", \"Strategies\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                }
              ],
              "rootNode": "start_1770753209563"
            },
            "loopType": "PARALLEL",
            "name": "GENERATE STRATEGIES FOR INDIVIDUAL GOAL"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
